# Stackra file contract:
# Purpose: the committed-manifest exception of this member: everything under .stackra/ is generated except the
#          contract artefacts other members build their clients from (app-manifest.json) and the OpenAPI projection.
#          Same rule set as the root .gitignore, repeated so the member folder keeps it when copied elsewhere.
# Boundary: ignore rules only. EAS does not read this file: the generated repo-root .easignore decides
#           what an upload carries, and it keeps the shims and `.stackra/` below.
# Runtime: node
# Governing contract: ADR 0158, ADR 0268
# gen output, except the committed contract artefacts
.stackra/*
!.stackra/app-manifest.json
!.stackra/openapi.json
# template only: the generated samples are committed so they can be read; a real project drops the next line
!.stackra/**
# generated root shims (Expo CLI and EAS read the member root; each re-exports or copies its .stackra/ file)
/app.config.ts
/metro.config.js
/eas.json
# build output
dist/
# Expo CLI cache and the native projects `expo prebuild` writes
.expo/
ios/
android/
# Maestro screenshots, logs and reports (`testOutputDir`)
maestro-report/
